8f4e/v1

note invalidHome
; @pos 100 100
; @home middle
; @home left extra
These invalid markers must not override the valid home block below.
noteEnd

note wide
; @pos 10 10
; @home
; @config font ibmvga8x16
; @config color.surface #205080
This deliberately wide note gives the home block a heavier spring profile.
Its top-left corner should align with the requested preview position.
The preview is cropped by the fixed-size output.
The capture should not depend on the spring having time to settle.
One more line keeps the block's area in the highest profile.
The background color makes the block's visible edge easy to measure.
This note has no runtime requirements.
noteEnd
